---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import iutInfo from '../../assets/iutinfo.gif'
import ContentPage from '../../layouts/ContentPage.astro'
---

<ContentPage
  pageKey="departement"
  title="Computer science department"
  heading="The computer science departments at the IUT"
  description="Computer science at the IUT: the DUT (L2 level), the Professional Licence Computer and Software Systems (L3 level) and the VAE."
>
  <figure class="portrait">
    <Image
      src={iutInfo}
      alt="Logo of the IUT computer science departments"
      width={170}
      height={138}
    />
  </figure>
  <p class="lead">
    The teaching of computer science at the IUT gives a large part to the professional dimension
    while retaining fundamental components; the student thus acquires know-how but also knowledge,
    basic concepts and methods of work that they will be able to put to use in a professional
    situation.
  </p>
  <h2>
    The DUT, university and professional diploma (level L2 of the LMD scheme, 120 European credits)
  </h2>
  <p>
    The holders of the DUT in computer science are senior technicians, able to participate in the
    design, realisation and implementation of computer systems. They can, however, if they wish,
    continue their studies at the end of this degree.
  </p>
  <h2>
    The Professional Licence “Computer and Software Systems” (SIL), L3 degree in the LMD scheme
    (Bachelor’s degree, 180 European credits)
  </h2>
  <p>
    <a href="http://www.iut-informatique.fr/LicencesProfessionnelles/"
      >These pages present the professional licences</a
    > offered in the IUT computer science departments.
  </p>
  <p>
    The holders of the SIL licence are specialists capable of participating in a software
    development project and, ultimately, taking full responsibility for it.
  </p>
  <h2>Validation of acquired experience</h2>
  <p>
    It is also possible to have your experience (professional or otherwise) recognised in order to
    obtain a degree, a title or a certificate of professional qualification. You can visit the
    government website concerning the
    <a
      href="https://travail-emploi.gouv.fr/formation-professionnelle/evoluer-professionnellement/vae"
      >validation of acquired experience (VAE)</a
    >.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
